                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                     <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-xl bg-[#f8fafe] dark:bg-[#1a222c] p-8">
                        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-[#1269e2]/40">format_quote</span>
                            <p class="text-[#111418] dark:text-gray-200 font-medium text-lg leading-relaxed">"Professional, clean, and on time. The permitting process was a breeze thanks to their local knowledge. Highly recommend for any high-end work."</p>
